{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55682","headline":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进一诗 六 · 延寿","name":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进一诗 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登云步岭涉烟程，好景随心次第生。\n圣者已符祥瑞事，地灵全副祷祈情。\n洞深重叠拖云湿，滩浅潺湲漱水清。\n愿满事圆归去路，便风相送片帆轻。\n（见《四库全书珍本初集》本宋林表民《天台前集别编》。\n（按：《全唐诗》卷八五一收六诗，仅云爲「吴越僧」作。\n今确定爲吴越释延寿作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55682.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55682","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}